<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said it would auction 3.300 billion pesos worth of Cetes at the primary auction on Monday.</p>
<p>    Terms	   Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>     28  days     900 million pesos  29.22 pct</p>
<p>     91  days     900 million pesos  27.61 pct</p>
<p>    182  days     900 million pesos  24.58 pct</p>
<p>    350  days     600 million pesos  21.42 pct</p>
<p>The central bank said it will also offer 1.000 billion pesos worth of 363-day and 728-day Bondes.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559</p>
</text>
